Tumhare steps ab:

Zarurat ho to npm run build:static (fresh out/).
npm run cap:sync:bundled (remote APK nahi chahiye to yahi use karo;
 plain cap:copy:android tab bhi OK hai agar env me remote vars set nahi hain).
Android Studio / Gradle se naya APK build & install.
Note: Agar PowerShell session me CAP_USE_REMOTE_WEB=1 permanent set hai
 to normal npx cap sync phir se remote inject kar sakta hai — 
 isliye bundled ke liye npm run cap:sync:bundled use karna safe hai.
  Remote test ke liye phir npm run cap:sync:remote chalao.